{"id":"4fcdcfdb0b1f6b92","group":"58","path":"58/batch02/58-df-vitali.md","title":"Vitali Equivalence","display":"df-vitali — Vitali Equivalence","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-vitali","aliases":["58-df-vitali","Vitali Equivalence"],"display":"df-vitali — Vitali Equivalence","depends_on":["[[../batch13/58-df-rational.md]]","[[58-df-equivalence-relation]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-vitali"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-vitali</span><span>Vitali Equivalence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-vitali — Vitali Equivalence"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"21c0965b79ed66aa\" href=\"?note=21c0965b79ed66aa\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-rational.md\">../batch13/58-df-rational.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"908bc7b079f5d25b\" href=\"?note=908bc7b079f5d25b\" title=\"58-df-equivalence-relation\">58-df-equivalence-relation</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y\\in[0,1]\">\\(x,y\\in[0,1]\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb Q\">\\(\\mathbb Q\\)</span> 为有理数集（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"21c0965b79ed66aa\" href=\"?note=21c0965b79ed66aa\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-rational.md\">../batch13/58-df-rational.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sim_{\\mathbb Q}\">\\(\\sim_{\\mathbb Q}\\)</span>（本文件定义的 Vitali 等价关系）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}vitali} \\vdash x\\sim_{\\mathbb Q}y\\leftrightarrow\\left(x-y\\in\\mathbb Q\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}vitali} \\vdash x\\sim_{\\mathbb Q}y\\leftrightarrow\\left(x-y\\in\\mathbb Q\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Vitali 集是商集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[0,1]/\\mathord{\\sim_{\\mathbb Q}}\">\\([0,1]/\\mathord{\\sim_{\\mathbb Q}}\\)</span> 的选择集；经典构造使用选择公理，但所需选择原则可弱于完整 AC。</li>\n<li>Non-measurable: cannot assign Lebesgue measure consistently; violates translation invariance</li>\n<li>依赖选择公理 DC 本身不推出存在 Vitali 集；Solovay 模型说明在适当一致性假设下，ZF+DC 可与“每个实数集均 Lebesgue 可测”相容。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Oxtoby, Measure and Category</li>\n<li>Jech, Set Theory</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch13/58-df-rational.md","status":"resolved","id":"21c0965b79ed66aa","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-rational.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-equivalence-relation","status":"resolved","id":"908bc7b079f5d25b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-equivalence-relation]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-rational.md","status":"resolved","id":"21c0965b79ed66aa","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathbb Q$ 为有理数集（see [[../batch13/58-df-rational.md]]）","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"x,y\\in[0,1]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb Q","display":false},{"tex":"\\sim_{\\mathbb Q}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}vitali} \\vdash x\\sim_{\\mathbb Q}y\\leftrightarrow\\left(x-y\\in\\mathbb Q\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"[0,1]/\\mathord{\\sim_{\\mathbb Q}}","display":false}],"bytes":1080,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1370","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-vitali.md|58-df-vitali]]（batch02）"}],"outgoing":["21c0965b79ed66aa","908bc7b079f5d25b"]}